  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OSCE Melange Rocket Fuel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OSCE Melange Rocket Fuel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Ukraine asked the OSCE for assistance in 2004 to eliminate the rocket fuel Melange. OSCE made a feasibility study in 2005 which concluded that the storage facilities should be eliminated within 3-4 years to avoid a catastrophe. The OSCE has now gathered donors, prepared procurement for this 24-month pilot elimination phase aiming to destroy the first 3000 tons of the stockpiles.</narrative>
